# Presentation quality gates

Before marking a deck **done**, verify:

## Story

- [ ] Every slide title is an **insight** (consulting: action title; pitch: outcome-oriented)
- [ ] Executive summary / ask appears in first 3 slides where applicable
- [ ] MECE structure for consulting sections
- [ ] Appendix holds backup — not main narrative clutter

## Visual

- [ ] 16:9, margins ≥ 0.5", body font ≥ 16pt
- [ ] Consistent brand from `deck-theme.ts` or design-systems
- [ ] Charts: titled with insight, labeled axes, sourced

## Deliverables

- [ ] `deck.pptx` exists and path reported to user
- [ ] Speaker notes on every slide (in PPTX or separate md)
- [ ] `outline.md` / `storyline.md` committed to outputs folder

## Skills used

| Deck type | Storyline skill | Build skill |
|-----------|-----------------|-------------|
| Consulting | `management-consultant-deck` | `presentation-architect` |
| Investor pitch | `pitch-deck-architect` | `presentation-architect` |
| General business | outline in chat | `presentation-architect` |

Do not deliver bullet-only outlines without PPTX unless user explicitly asked for outline-only.
